<title>INDIA: India Larsen jumps after rise in Q1 net.</title>
<headline>India Larsen jumps after rise in Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Indian engineering and construction giant Larsen &amp; Toubro Ltd. rose four percent to 285.0 rupees -- a new 52-week high -- at the Bombay exchange on Monday after the firm posted a rise in 1997/98 first quarter sales, traders said.</p>
